<title>USA: First Chicago wins $100 mln Illinois GO bonds.</title>
<headline>First Chicago wins $100 mln Illinois GO bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Chicago Capital Markets said it won $100 million of Illinois general obligation bonds, Series of July 1997, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.10 percent.</p>
</text>
